+// PW64 split-screen pilot collisions (splitscreen.md "Collisions"): the
+// original game has no vehicle-vs-vehicle test. With pw64_split_collide on
+// (latched at test start), two pilots whose spheres touch both take their
+// vehicle's own hard-impact path, the one a fast hit on a building or tree
+// takes: hang glider, gyrocopter, rocket belt and birdman tumble (scream,
